  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Jukha. Objective: Avoid being the last player holding the Joker.',
    Player: 'Jukha: play by the rules, manage scoring opportunities, and pursue the win condition.',
    objective: 'Players try to collect four equal cards so they can show them and exit the game; the last two players remaining are the losers, and whoever holds the Joker cannot exit.',
    gameplay: '1. All players discard matching pairs (e.g., two Queens, two 7s).\n2. Each player in turn draws one card from the person to their right.\n3. If it matches a card in hand, discard the pair. If not, add it to your hand.\n4. **EXIT**: If you have NO cards left and do NOT hold the Joker, you are safe and leave the game.\n5. **The Joker Rule**: You can NEVER exit if you have the Joker. You must wait for someone to draw it from you.',
